        "delivery_content": "<p></p><p>Orders<br/><br/>Q. Can I cancel or modify my order after placing it?<br/>Orders are processed shortly after confirmation. Once an order has been shipped, it cannot be cancelled or modified. Please contact us as soon as possible if you need assistance.<br/><br/>⸻<br/><br/>Shipping<br/><br/>Q. Do you ship internationally?<br/>Yes. We offer international shipping to selected destinations. Shipping fees and delivery times vary depending on the destination and will be calculated at checkout.<br/><br/>Q. How long does shipping take?<br/>Orders are typically processed within 1–3 business days. Delivery times vary by location and carrier.<br/><br/>⸻<br/><br/>Returns & Exchanges<br/><br/>Q. Do you accept returns or exchanges?<br/>Returns are accepted within the period stated in our Returns Policy, provided items are unused and in original condition. Some items may be non-returnable. Please refer to our Returns Policy for details.<br/><br/>Q. Who covers return shipping costs?<br/>Return shipping costs are the responsibility of the customer unless the item is defective or incorrect.<br/><br/>⸻<br/><br/>Products<br/><br/>Q. Are all items authentic?<br/>Yes. All products offered on our site are 100% authentic and sourced directly from brands or authorized partners.<br/><br/>Q. Will sold-out items be restocked?<br/>Restocks depend on brand availability and season. We recommend signing up for notifications or contacting us for updates.<br/><br/>⸻<br/><br/>Payments<br/><br/>Q. What payment methods do you accept?<br/>We accept major credit cards and other payment methods supported by Shopify Payments. Available options may vary by region.<br/><br/>⸻<br/><br/>Contact<br/><br/>Q. How can I contact you?<br/>For any inquiries, please reach us via the Contact page or email. We aim to respond within 1–2 business days.</p>",
